abstract: >-
  A hardware-free, multi-source decentralized parametric crop insurance research prototype
  designed for Rayalaseema smallholder groundnut farming in Andhra Pradesh, India.
  Synthesizes Open-Meteo rainfall, Sentinel-2 NDVI, and NASA SMAP soil moisture via 2-of-3
  on-chain oracle consensus and median fallback on Ethereum smart contracts.
